  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Rural Development Project of Mo Plain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at improving incomes and livelihoods for the population of Togo in general and the inhabitants of the impoverished Mo Plain area in particular through promotion of agricultural development as well as the rehabilitation and development of basic rural infrastructures in order to end the physical isolation of the area.</narrative>
  </description>
